Test fixtures: commercial lease documents
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
packages/extract-sdk/tests/fixtures/real-leases/ contains 22 commercial lease
documents sourced from public SEC EDGAR filings (8-K and 10-K exhibits). See
real_lease_manifest.json in that directory for the per-document provenance.
Public filings; no license restrictions.

backend/tests/fixtures/real_lease_*.pdf are published model and government
forms (California model lease, CAR form, City of Chicago municipal lease,
State of Georgia lease).


